<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs estimate Tuesday 100,000-USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs estimate Tuesday 100,000-USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said Tuesday's est receipts 100,000, Wk ago 100,000, and Yr ago 98,000 head. Estimates include generally about 60 percent Carcass Base Hogs. Barrows and gilts traded $1.50 higher than mid-session Monday. Trade was slow for goood demand and light offerings. Top $57.00 per cwt.</p>
<p>				Country		  Plants</p>
<p>US 1-3   46-49% Carcass Base Lean*</p>
<p>220-260 lbs		 54.50 -55.50	   55.50 -56.50</p>
<p>few			   54.00  56.00	   55.00  57.00</p>
<p>US 1-3   46-49% Carcass Base Lean*</p>
<p>260-280 lbs		 52.50 -55.50	   53.00 -56.50</p>
<p>US 2-4   43-49% Carcass Base Lean</p>
<p>280-300 lbs		 49.00 -54.00	   49.50 -55.00</p>
<p>Sows - up $1.00-3.50. Top $55.50. US 1-3 300-450 lbs.     42.00 -44.00	   43.00 -44.00</p>
<p>450-500 lbs.		46.00 -50.00	   47.00 -51.00</p>
<p>500 lbs. up		 50.00 -54.50	   50.00 -55.50</p>
